      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Req\n1. User should be able to input the start and end location\nand get an estimated fare.\n2. User should be able to book/cancel the ride\n3. Driver should be able to accept the rider.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Req\n1. User should be able to input the start and end location and get an estimated fare.\n2. User should be able to book/cancel the ride\n3. Driver should be able to accept the rider.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
